  "description": "Used as a bargaining chip to protect the House of Eagles, Shupena, a tiny blue bird, finds herself betrothed to the heir of the House of Lions, Ricador Chadwick. As the villainess who is later tossed aside once he meets the real female lead, she hopes to keep her distance until a divorce can happen. But when Ricador shows much warmth and attachment for Shupena, will it still be possible to resist the temptation of getting closer? Or will the winds carry her into the arms of her new husband?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
